<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Silver Lining</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">When We Were Younger</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7GK7Rwoc1kia9GvZ31fICE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.296" end="00:16.591">I was waiting by the ocean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.591" end="00:24.591">Staring endlessly into this void of separation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.379" end="00:31.289">Of lovers and a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.289" end="00:36.883">'Cause we don't talk as deep as we used to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.883" end="00:41.541">If I, wanted the weather I could just watch the news</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.541" end="00:44.357">I fear we're losing touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.357" end="00:47.817">But part of me still feels in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.817" end="00:51.886">Guess somethings just can't stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.886" end="00:53.386" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.256" end="00:57.389">But what if you and I had passed us by?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.389" end="01:01.610">How different our lives would be?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.610" end="01:05.700">Even if our stars don't end up aligning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.700" end="01:12.197">There's a silver lining between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.197" end="01:17.173">I'm just happy that I once held you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.173" end="01:25.173">Held you close to me (Held you close to me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.328" end="01:31.828" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.699" end="01:34.506">It's hard to say that I'll be fine on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.506" end="01:40.104">I remember how you taught me to turn your heart to a home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.104" end="01:45.522">If you were still around, you'd say that I'm acting strange</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.522" end="01:49.604">I just can't help but miss those days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.604" end="01:51.104" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.774" end="01:55.522">So, what if you and I had passed us by?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.522" end="01:59.739">How different our lives would be?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.739" end="02:03.701">Even if our stars don't end up aligning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.701" end="02:10.181">There's a silver lining between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.181" end="02:15.359">I'm just happy that I once held you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.359" end="02:23.359">Held you close to me (Held you close to me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.957" end="02:40.457" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.310" end="02:47.310">And I hope you know that there were more than memories babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.681" end="02:57.533">All the things that you said are still hold up in me today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.533" end="03:05.533">If times could change and take me back I don't think that I would change a single thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.333" end="03:14.698">We parted ways but it's time well spent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.698" end="03:20.102">So love and peace in this life 'til the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.102" end="03:21.602" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.269" end="03:25.131">So, what if you and I had passed us by?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.131" end="03:29.472">How different our lives would be?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.472" end="03:33.520">Even if our stars don't end up aligning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.520" end="03:37.520">There's a silver lining between</p></div></body></tt>